  "source": "https://huggingface.co/baidu/Qianfan-OCR",
  "notes": "End-to-end document model on a Qwen3-4B backbone. Tables as HTML, formulas as LaTeX, 192 languages claimed. Its layout thinking mode is left off. Not yet run on BAM hardware."
